<title>RUSSIA: Russia's UES details subsidiary results.</title>
<headline>Russia's UES details subsidiary results.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unified Energy System (UES), Russia's national power company, issued the following results of its subsidiaries on Monday.</p>
<p>RAO Yedinaya Energeticheskaya Sistema Rossii (UES) controls most of Russia's regional power companies (energos) as well as operating the national grid and owning its own power stations.</p>
<p>The figures, in billion roubles, are for 1996 without comparisons. They are to Russian accounting standards on an accruals basis. Figures for UES itself are not consolidated.</p>
